  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. route_handler.py ~:615-620 still classifies by '@' else rails, and the rails resolver needs '#'. Fixture (conf/routes with 3 routes + app/controllers/UserController.scala) via `hypergumbo run`: route markers carry controller_action controllers.UserController.list etc., and there are 0 dispatches_to edges (only scala calls/imports/extends). play_routes.py's top docstring now states the gap (line ~22), but its line ~114 docstring still claims route_handler creates dispatches_to edges. MECHANISM: route_handler._extract_handler_ref dispatches on separator ('@' -> laravel, else rails) instead of on producer, so Play's dotted controllers.Foo.bar fails the rails '#' split. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: none."  # f77c
